om/wp/media/denmark_something-768x764.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_something-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_something.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9275\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/denmark_something/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_something.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,995\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Something/Come Together single artwork \u2013 Denmark\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_something-960x955.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/netherlands_something/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_something-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Something single artwork - Netherlands\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_something-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_something-580x580.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_something-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_something.jpg 717w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9818\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/netherlands_something/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_something.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"717,716\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Something single artwork \u2013 Netherlands\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_something.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/yugoslavia_something/'><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"198\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/yugoslavia_something-200x198.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Something/Come Together single artwork - Yugoslavia\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/yugoslavia_something-200x198.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/yugoslavia_something-580x575.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/yugoslavia_something-960x952.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/yugoslavia_something-768x762.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/yugoslavia_something-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/yugoslavia_something.jpg 974w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"10297\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/yugoslavia_something/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/yugoslavia_something.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"974,966\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Something/Come Together single artwork \u2013 Yugoslavia\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/yugoslavia_something-960x952.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/japan_something/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTk3IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE5NyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"197\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_something-200x197.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Come Together/Something single artwork - Japan\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_something-200x197.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_something-580x571.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_something-960x945.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_something-768x756.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_something-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_something.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9600\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/japan_something/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_something.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,984\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Come Together/Something single artwork \u2013 Japan\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_something-960x945.jpg\" /></a></div></figure></div><h2><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Chart_success\"></span>Chart success<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2><p><a href=\"/1969/09/26/uk-lp-abbey-road/\">Initially released</a> on the <a href=\"/albums/abbey-road/\"><em>Abbey Road</em></a> album, the song was subsequently issued in the US and UK as a double a-side single, along with <a href=\"/songs/come-together/\">&#8216;Come Together&#8217;</a>, on <a href=\"/1969/10/06/us-single-something-come-together/\">6 October 1969</a>. In the UK it was the only time that a single was taken from an already-released Beatles album; previously they had either released songs ahead of their albums, or on the same day.</p><blockquote><div>&#8216;Something&#8217; was George&#8217;s first single, released in October. It was a great song, and frankly I was surprised that George had it in him.</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\">George Martin<br />\n<a href=\"https://geni.us/anthologypb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>Anthology</em></a></div><p>&#8216;Something&#8217; peaked at number four in the UK. In America it fared better, topping the <em>Billboard</em> chart for a week. It also marked the first time a George Harrison song was the a-side of a Beatles single.</p><div class=\"fab-forum-link\"><a href=\"/fab-forum/the-songs/something/\">Discuss &#8216;Something&#8217; on the Fab Forum \u00bb</a></div><div class=\"wp-post-navigation\"><div class=\"wp-post-navigation-pre\"> <strong>Previous song:</strong> <a href=\"/songs/come-together/\">&#8216;Come Together&#8217;</a></div><div class=\"wp-post-navigation-next\"> <strong>Next song:</strong> <a href=\"/songs/maxwells-silver-hammer/\">&#8216;Maxwell&#8217;s Silver Hammer&#8217;</a></div></div><div align=\"center\" style=\"clear:both;margin:15px 0;\"></div><div class=\"page-links\">Pages: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/something/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">1</span></a> <span class=\"post-page-numbers current\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"page-link\">2</span></span></div>",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-10-25"
}